      "id": "modal",
      "url": "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/objectivec/nsobject-swift.class/accessibilityviewismodal",
      "section": "UIAccessibility.h modal/descendant-hidden flags; heading and button properties",
      "statement": "Configure modal contents and hide the separate background subtree; snapshot/restore and hierarchy guards are project lifecycle policy.",
      "availability": "Established UIKit APIs; UIAction registration iOS14+; deployment26.0.",
      "reviewedOn": "2026-11-05"
    },
    {
      "id": "notification",
      "url": "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/uikit/uiaccessibility/post(notification:argument:)",
      "section": "UIAccessibilityConstants.h screen-changed notification; UIAccessibility.h post",
      "statement": "A notification can carry a target argument. Tests capture a request after injected completion, not actual focus delivery; generation/ownership behavior is project policy.",
      "availability": "Established UIKit APIs; UIAction registration iOS14+; deployment26.0.",
      "reviewedOn": "2026-11-05"
    },
    {
      "id": "escape",
      "url": "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/objectivec/nsobject-swift.class/accessibilityperformescape()",
      "section": "UIAccessibility.h escape; UIControl.h ordinary action dispatch",
      "statement": "Provide a direct escape handler and ordinary Close action sharing dismissal policy. Direct calls do not prove actual gesture delivery.",
      "availability": "Established UIKit APIs; UIAction registration iOS14+; deployment26.0.",
      "reviewedOn": "2026-11-05"
    }
  ],
